                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3ed81e5-55cc-4f9f-9f41-14acc8c556b7",
                                "sense_id": "75b26bfb-2247-325e-9690-1fe7709993da",
                                "text": "\"You could always pick names, Thomas. I remember women you turned down because you didn't like their names. Gorgeous, hot women, but with flat names. Darby. Has a nice, erotic touch to it. What a name."
